---
import { providerLogos } from '../../../../packages/provider-registry/logos';
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import presets from '../../../../packages/provider-registry/providers.json';
import product from '../../../../packages/product-info/product.json';
---

<Site>
  <main>
    <section class="hero section-wrap">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <a class="release-tag" href="/docs/changelog/"
          ><span class="dot"></span>{product.version} {product.channel} <span>↗</span></a
        ><h1>让 Codex，<br />连接<span class="accent">你的模型。</span></h1><p
          class="hero-description"
        >
          喜欢的模型，熟悉的工作方式。<br />为 Codex App 连接国内模型与中转站，<br
            class="desktop-break"
          />从此少折腾配置，多专注创作。
        </p><div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/download/">获取 Codex Switch <span>↗</span></a><a
            class="text-link"
            href="/docs/quickstart/">看看如何使用 <span>→</span></a
          >
        </div><p class="hero-note">macOS · Windows <span> / </span>本地运行 · 开源免费</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Codex Switch 界面示意">
        <div class="visual-grid"></div><div class="demo-window">
          <div class="window-bar">
            <span class="traffic"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Codex Switch</span><span
              class="window-settings">☷</span
            >
          </div><div class="demo-title"><h2>我的配置</h2><span>＋ 新增配置</span></div>
          <div class="demo-quick-list">
            {
              [
                {
                  id: 'deepseek',
                  name: '工作账号',
                  model: '2 个模型 · deepseek-flash、deepseek-v4-pro',
                },
                { id: 'kimi', name: 'Kimi', model: '2 个模型 · kimi-k2.7-code、kimi-k3' },
                { id: 'qianwen', name: '千问', model: '1 个模型 · qwen-plus' },
              ].map((p, i) => (
                <div class:list={['demo-quick-row', { selected: i < 2 }]}>
                  <>
                    <span class="demo-choice">{i < 2 ? '✓' : ''}</span>
                    <img
                      src={providerLogos[p.id]}
                      data-provider={p.id}
                      alt=""
                      width="24"
                      height="24"
                    />
                    <div>
                      <>
                        <b>{p.name}</b>
                        <small>{p.model}</small>
                      </>
                    </div>
                    <span class="demo-edit">✎</span>
                  </>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div><div class="demo-quick-control">
            <span id="demo-status">已开启</span><button
              id="demo-toggle"
              class="demo-toggle"
              role="switch"
              aria-checked="true"
              aria-label="体验开关效果"><span></span></button
            >
          </div>
          <div class="demo-profile-actions">
            <div class="demo-open"><span id="demo-action">配置已开启</span></div><div
              class="demo-open secondary-demo"
            >
              ↗ 打开 Codex
            </div>
          </div><div class="demo-secure">
            <span id="demo-note">开启前自动备份，关闭后恢复原配置。</span>
          </div>
        </div><div class="floating-note">
          <span>↶</span><div><b>随时回到原来的配置</b><small>试试上面的开关</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="providers-strip section-wrap" aria-label="支持的模型服务">
      <p>内置五家<br />国内服务预设。</p><div>
        {
          presets.map((p) => (
            <a href="/docs/providers/">
              <img src={providerLogos[p.id]} data-provider={p.id} alt="" width="22" height="22" />
              {p.name}
            </a>
          ))
        }<a href="/docs/relay/" class="custom-provider">＋ coding plan</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="steps-section section-wrap" id="how">
      <div class="section-kicker">FROM SETUP TO FLOW</div><div class="section-title">
        <h2>三步，回到创作。</h2><p>
          你只需要服务商的 API Key。<br />配置、备份和连接，交给 Codex Switch。
        </p>
      </div><div class="steps-grid">
        <article>
          <span class="step-number">01</span><div class="step-art chips">
            <span>DeepSeek <b>✓</b></span><span>Kimi</span><span>千问</span>
          </div><h3>新增配置</h3><p>内置五家国内模型服务。已有中转站？填入 API 地址即可。</p>
        </article><article>
          <span class="step-number">02</span><div class="step-art key-art">
            <span>API Key</span><strong>••••••••••••••••</strong><i>⌁</i>
          </div><h3>粘贴密钥</h3><p>
            为配置命名，填写一个 Key，勾选多个模型。验证后保存，密钥留在系统凭据库。
          </p>
        </article><article>
          <span class="step-number">03</span><div class="step-art launch-art">
            ↗ <b>配置到 Codex</b>
          </div><h3>打开 Codex</h3><p>
            首页可同时勾选多个配置。应用后打开 Codex，以「配置名称-模型」选择模型。
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="principles section-wrap">
      <div class="principle-main">
        <p class="section-kicker">A LITTLE UTILITY. A LOT LESS FRICTION.</p><h2>
          一枚开关，<br />进退自如。
        </h2><p>
          开启，使用你选择的连接。<br />关闭，恢复开启前的配置。<br
          />原先没有配置文件，也会回到原先的状态。
        </p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/switch/">了解备份与恢复 <span>→</span></a>
      </div><div class="principle-cards">
        <article>
          <span>01 / LOCAL FIRST</span><h3>你的密钥，你的设备。</h3><p>
            密钥存入系统凭据库，请求从本机发往所选服务。没有 Codex Switch 云端中转。
          </p>
        </article><article>
          <span>02 / FOCUSED BY DESIGN</span><h3>只为 Codex App。</h3><p>
            一个简明的配置页面。多选启用、编辑模型、打开 Codex，都在这里。
          </p>
        </article><article>
          <span>03 / OPEN BY DEFAULT</span><h3>开源，也说明边界。</h3><p>
            支持原生 Responses 和 Chat 接口转换。图片、远程压缩等能力，请先查看兼容说明。
          </p><a href="/docs/compatibility/">查看兼容范围 ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="final-cta section-wrap">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">READY WHEN YOU ARE</p><h2>把时间，留给想做的事。</h2><p>
          从一个连接开始。
        </p>
      </div><a class="button" href="/download/">获取 Codex Switch <span>↗</span></a>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script>
    const toggle = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#demo-toggle');
    toggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const on = toggle.getAttribute('aria-checked') !== 'true';
      toggle.setAttribute('aria-checked', String(on));
      document.querySelector('#demo-status')!.textContent = on ? '已开启' : '已关闭';
      document.querySelector('#demo-action')!.textContent = on ? '配置已开启' : '配置到 Codex';
      document.querySelector('#demo-note')!.textContent = on
        ? '开启前保存原配置，关闭后恢复。'
        : '已恢复开启前的配置。';
    });
  </script>
</Site>
